<title>EGYPT: Nile Match end-Q3 results.</title>
<headline>Nile Match end-Q3 results.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-06-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for the first nine months of the financial year 1996/7, which started on July 1:</p>
<p>(All figures in Egyptian pounds, no comparative figures available):</p>
<p>Net sales			    51,141,000</p>
<p>Production costs		   41,637,000</p>
<p>Overheads			     6,391,000</p>
<p>Exceptional revenue		   678,000</p>
<p>Exceptional expenses		  348,000</p>
<p>Net profit before tax	     3,443,000</p>
<p>(Full company name is Nile Match and Prefabricated Houses)</p>
<p>$1 =3.395 pounds</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
</text>
